uplink-bloodlust-implanter-name = Bloodlust Implanter
uplink-bloodlust-implanter-desc = A powerful experimental implant with a huge copy of constructed personalities. A companion only you can see appears next to you and comments on the carnage, while its sparks deflect bullets away from you.

ent-BloodlustImplanter = bloodlust implanter
    .desc = An experimental implanter with a huge copy of constructed personalities.
ent-BloodlustImplant = bloodlust implant
    .desc = An experimental implant carrying a copy of countless constructed personalities. One of them is always awake.
ent-BloodlustCompanion = voice of carnage
    .desc = She really, really wants a massacre.
ent-BloodlustSparkBase = spark
ent-BloodlustSpark1 = spark
ent-BloodlustSpark2 = spark
ent-BloodlustSpark3 = spark

bloodlust-chat-wrap = [color=#ff3355][bold]{ $name }[/bold]: { $message }[/color]
bloodlust-greeting = Well hello there! Fun times ahead!

bloodlust-combat-1 = Carnage and fun, let's go!
bloodlust-combat-2 = More blood, more fun!
bloodlust-combat-3 = Ha-ha! Now that's what I'm talking about!
bloodlust-combat-4 = Don't stop, they're still twitching!
bloodlust-combat-5 = Fire, fire, fire!
bloodlust-combat-6 = More! More! More!
bloodlust-combat-7 = Show them what real carnage is!
bloodlust-combat-8 = The music of battle is the best music!

bloodlust-kill-1 = One down! Who's next?
bloodlust-kill-2 = Beautiful! Do it again!
bloodlust-kill-3 = Did you see his face? Priceless!
bloodlust-kill-4 = One down, and it's only the beginning!
bloodlust-kill-5 = Heh-heh, he didn't even have time to be surprised.
bloodlust-kill-6 = Keep it up, that was divine!
bloodlust-kill-7 = Put him on the list. It's a long list.

bloodlust-idle-1 = Boring... Where is everyone? I want carnage.
bloodlust-idle-2 = Hey, not tired yet? I'm not.
bloodlust-idle-3 = I can feel their pulses. Shall we?
bloodlust-idle-4 = Let's find somebody already, huh?
bloodlust-idle-5 = You know, this station is full of people...
bloodlust-idle-6 = You're just standing there? Seriously?
bloodlust-idle-7 = Silence is a polite way of saying it's time to act.
bloodlust-idle-8 = I'm ready to have fun right now!
